;
; Module-definition file of every radio plugin on Windows (RAD-133): only
; the entry point is exported. Upstream libraries' own dllexport
; directives are removed from their archives (tools/deps/sdr.cmake), so
; nothing else is exported next to it.
EXPORTS
    yantra_radio_entry
